==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|k|u}}

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Uralic|kola-|lang=fi}}; cognate with Hungarian {{term|hal|lang=hu}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=fi|[ˈkuɔlːɑˣ]}}
* {{rhymes|lang=fi|uolːɑ}}
* {{hyphenation|kuol|la}}

===Verb===
{{infl|fi|verb}}

# {{intransitive|_|+ illative}} To [[die]] of/from.
#: ''[[isoäiti|Isoäiti]][[-ni|ni]] '''kuoli''' [[syöpä|syöpään]].''
#:: ''My grandmother '''died''' of cancer.''

